OL,5,G0232 Assignment
OL,6,     FChina once thought it had too many
OL,7,     Fchildren - now it thinks there are
OL,8,     Ftoo few. Its population is
OL,9,     Fdeclining. Micky Bristow looks
OL,10,     Finto what this means for the
OL,11,     Ffuture.
OL,12,G0300 BBC News
OL,13,     FThe latest five minute news
OL,14,     Fbulletin from BBC World Service.
OL,15,G0306 Outlook
OL,16,     FAs a child, Nina Blom experienced
OL,17,     Fyears of hospitalisation and pain
OL,18,     Fbefore one doctor discovered what
OL,19,     Freally lay behind it all.
