OL,5,G0350 Witness History
OL,6,     FIn 1962, cameras were allowed into
OL,7,     Fthe renovated White House for the
OL,8,     Ffirst televised tour. And, acting
OL,9,     Fas the guide, was one of America's
OL,10,     Fmost famous first ladies, Jackie
OL,11,     FKennedy.
